   "want": "ask_favor"
  }
 ],
 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Never mind the pantry run — we got it handled. Thanks anyway. My cut needs a second pair of hands. Will you help me clean it?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"It's getting worse, not better. If it festers I'm no good to anyone — can't haul, can't hunt, can't watch. Just clean it out and wrap it tight.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Since Zoltan died... I keep expecting to see Zoltan at the fire. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Sleep's gone strange. I check everyone's shoes for wear at odd hours now. Whatever gets me to morning.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "You show them Mayapple — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"I wish we had longer. Soon, yeah?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Can we talk?\" Nadia keeps their voice low. \"The stores. Have you looked at the stores? We're running thin.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "They nod. \"Okay.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Help me haul something back? Too much for one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "At the cache spot the ground is torn up. Something was here, recently, and it wasn't careful. Nadia's hand finds your sleeve. You leave together, faster than you came."
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"That's the whole of it. Sorry.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"I dreamed Wei was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "You show them Wild Ramps — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 28,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  }
 ],
